# wfg-log 1
# fixture skeleton — the Phase 1 engine skeleton, hand-written and hand-checked.
# Every record here is one the engine must reproduce exactly when replayed:
# an applied command, a rejection of each kind the skeleton can produce, and a
# dropped packet keeping its place in the sequence. Nothing in it needs a
# document, so it is the earliest possible test of the replay guarantee.
A 0 0 cli noop
A 0 1 ws:192.168.1.20:51234 noop
R 0 2 udp:192.168.1.7:9000 unknown-command no.such.command i:1 s:"with arguments"
X 0 3 udp:192.168.1.7:9000 malformed-packet b:LyIvAAAsZgAA
A 12 4 cli noop
R 12 5 ws:192.168.1.20:51234 arity noop i:7
R 25 6 cli unknown-command cue.create s:"House to half"
A 25 7 udp:10.0.0.5:9000 noop
